WEBVTT

01:29.360 --> 01:33.140
[Cage of Shadows]

01:33.470 --> 01:36.120
[Episode 22]

01:42.580 --> 01:43.350
Master.

01:43.400 --> 01:45.200
I failed to maintain discipline

01:45.210 --> 01:46.289
and deserve death.

01:47.810 --> 01:49.030
Kill her,

01:49.200 --> 01:51.060
and I will absolve you of all guilt

01:51.640 --> 01:52.970
and let the matter rest.

02:03.350 --> 02:05.210
Thank you for your mercy, Master.

02:11.580 --> 02:14.410
Zhuang Wujiu, you have rebelled
against your superiors

02:14.410 --> 02:16.560
and shown utter disrespect
for your elders.

02:16.560 --> 02:17.880
Out of our years

02:17.960 --> 02:20.150
of father–daughter bond,

02:20.250 --> 02:21.710
I will give you one chance—

02:21.760 --> 02:22.800
end your own life.

02:22.820 --> 02:25.020
Spare me the trouble of doing it myself.

03:01.840 --> 03:02.640
So

03:03.400 --> 03:05.880
your so-called fatherly affection
was just an act in the end.

03:05.880 --> 03:08.080
You couldn't even keep up the pretense.

03:08.240 --> 03:09.480
Preposterous!

03:10.160 --> 03:11.700
I gave you life.

03:12.200 --> 03:14.000
If I want you dead, you will die.

03:14.000 --> 03:15.920
My mother gave me my life.

03:16.320 --> 03:19.050
Back then, you defiled my mother
in Lingya Tower.

03:19.280 --> 03:23.210
Do you know that my very existence
is the shame she carried all her life?

03:37.290 --> 03:39.050
Even if I wronged your mother,

03:39.079 --> 03:40.760
I have not treated you badly.

03:40.990 --> 03:42.770
Forcing me back to Lingya Tower back then

03:42.770 --> 03:45.370
was only to turn me
into your killing weapon.

03:46.120 --> 03:49.470
You used all those so-called rules
of propriety and family ethics
to control me.

03:49.470 --> 03:51.329
But when life and death were on the line,

03:51.329 --> 03:53.910
I was nothing more than
a disposable pawn to you.

03:53.910 --> 03:55.520
That is your destiny.

03:56.590 --> 03:58.820
And today, I will reclaim your life.

04:02.730 --> 04:04.730
You are not worthy of being a father.

04:08.080 --> 04:08.880
Wujiu,

04:09.740 --> 04:10.950
be obedient.

04:12.720 --> 04:14.400
Listen to me.

04:16.529 --> 04:17.490
"Be obedient."

04:17.510 --> 04:18.930
"Resign yourself to fate."

04:18.930 --> 04:21.190
I've heard those words countless times.

04:21.470 --> 04:22.410
And every time I hear them,

04:22.410 --> 04:24.340
my urge to kill you grows stronger.

04:24.480 --> 04:26.120
You lowly woman!

04:26.440 --> 04:28.700
There is no forgiveness for your crimes.

04:40.950 --> 04:42.240
Meng Shuo, your crimes
are beyond redemption.

04:42.240 --> 04:43.330
Heaven cannot tolerate you.

04:43.330 --> 04:44.760
For my mother,

04:45.320 --> 04:48.310
and for all the lives
you trampled in Lingya Tower,

04:48.760 --> 04:51.290
I will carry out justice
in the name of heaven.

04:52.340 --> 04:53.060
Wujiu...

04:53.090 --> 04:53.620
do you...

04:54.210 --> 04:57.050
do you truly hate me that much?

05:20.680 --> 05:22.130
If not for Yanzhi,

05:23.200 --> 05:25.600
why would I have needed
to wait until today?

05:34.340 --> 05:35.470
What a performance.

05:36.310 --> 05:37.700
This is the most brilliant

05:37.700 --> 05:39.950
death match

05:40.570 --> 05:41.810
I've ever seen.

05:42.440 --> 05:43.560
What a pity—

05:43.640 --> 05:46.520
Meng Shuo labored for Lingya Tower
for so many years,

05:46.520 --> 05:49.700
only to end up dying at the hands
of his own daughter.

05:50.570 --> 05:52.980
Tragic... truly tragic.

05:53.200 --> 05:55.460
No need for this hypocritical sympathy.

05:55.970 --> 05:56.730
You are

05:57.159 --> 05:59.880
the true culprit
behind Lingya Tower's crimes.

06:05.980 --> 06:07.200
Just them?

06:07.510 --> 06:09.230
You think they can stop me?

06:09.360 --> 06:10.400
Hahaha...

06:11.470 --> 06:14.030
Young people are always so impatient.

06:14.410 --> 06:16.010
The show isn't even over yet—

06:16.050 --> 06:18.650
why rush to leave the stage?

06:25.020 --> 06:26.200
Qi.

06:26.990 --> 06:27.770
Yanzhi.

06:30.970 --> 06:31.930
Let her go.

06:32.100 --> 06:33.110
Zhuang Wujiu,

06:34.159 --> 06:36.720
I'll make you finish this performance.

06:37.280 --> 06:38.950
Surrender yourself...

06:39.120 --> 06:39.920
or

06:42.030 --> 06:43.590
watch her die.

06:58.080 --> 06:58.920
You...

07:00.120 --> 07:01.940
You are truly despicable.

07:02.160 --> 07:04.960
Hahahahaha...

07:17.610 --> 07:19.540
As a senior statesman of the realm,

07:19.670 --> 07:21.780
you privately established Lingya Tower

07:21.780 --> 07:24.000
and even took pleasure
in enslaving people.

07:24.000 --> 07:26.380
Aren't you afraid
that one day the truth will come out

07:26.380 --> 07:27.420
and you'll be utterly disgraced

07:27.420 --> 07:29.120
and infamous for all eternity?

07:29.120 --> 07:30.480
Do you really think

07:30.960 --> 07:32.990
exposing my identity

07:33.800 --> 07:35.590
will bring down Lingya Tower?

07:36.800 --> 07:37.600
Hmph.

07:38.150 --> 07:39.090
How childish.

07:40.340 --> 07:41.760
Over the years,

07:41.880 --> 07:44.680
it's not that no one has known
who I truly am—

07:45.440 --> 07:47.300
they simply don't dare speak out.

07:48.480 --> 07:50.270
Because they all understand

07:51.000 --> 07:51.860
that the moment

07:51.980 --> 07:53.840
anyone tries to reveal the truth,

07:54.700 --> 07:56.380
I won't even need to give an order—

07:56.380 --> 07:58.980
someone will make sure they stay silent.

07:59.120 --> 08:01.420
You are utterly inhuman,

08:01.450 --> 08:03.380
completely devoid of conscience.

08:03.720 --> 08:05.440
You will face retribution.

08:06.270 --> 08:07.070
Retribution?

08:09.060 --> 08:11.060
You mean these death row prisoners?

08:11.290 --> 08:13.410
If you think they were forced into it,

08:14.470 --> 08:16.040
you're mistaken.

08:17.810 --> 08:19.010
You don't believe me?

08:19.440 --> 08:20.400
Fine.

08:20.490 --> 08:22.400
Then I'll let you see it clearly.

08:24.880 --> 08:25.970
Qi,

08:26.930 --> 08:29.060
open every cell door.

08:31.570 --> 08:33.210
Open all the cells.

08:42.600 --> 08:45.730
These low-born criminals
are guilty of grave offenses.

08:47.080 --> 08:49.560
Even if they escape, so what?

08:52.000 --> 08:53.640
They'll still have nowhere to belong,

08:53.640 --> 08:55.040
nowhere to live in the light of day.

08:55.040 --> 08:56.680
At least here,

08:56.850 --> 08:58.640
they can cling
to what little life they have left

08:58.640 --> 09:00.640
and live out the rest of it in misery.

09:01.680 --> 09:03.680
Hahahaha...

09:06.450 --> 09:09.650
Hahahaha...

09:10.680 --> 09:14.480
Hahahaha...

09:19.650 --> 09:20.650
Qi,

09:21.010 --> 09:22.560
you've done well this time.

09:22.870 --> 09:26.600
It wasn't a waste keeping you
in hiding in the Tower all these years.

09:27.040 --> 09:28.840
You are truly a visionary, Master.

09:28.840 --> 09:30.900
I have only been acting under orders.

09:33.500 --> 09:34.670
Qi,

09:35.160 --> 09:36.290
from this moment on,

09:36.560 --> 09:39.020
you are the new Tower Master
of Lingya Tower.

09:40.850 --> 09:42.910
I am honored by your support, Master.

09:43.840 --> 09:46.280
I will serve you
even at the cost of my life.

10:03.080 --> 10:03.880
Qi...

10:04.080 --> 10:05.080
You're awake?

10:07.500 --> 10:09.460
If a new bride sleeps this much,

10:09.540 --> 10:11.720
she'll surely be picked on
by her in-laws one day.

10:11.720 --> 10:13.520
Hahaha...

10:13.920 --> 10:14.880
Thankfully,

10:15.400 --> 10:17.160
they're already dead.

10:24.760 --> 10:26.160
What did you make me eat?

10:26.240 --> 10:27.040
Relax.

10:28.560 --> 10:30.890
It's just some tendon-weakening powder.

10:33.840 --> 10:35.240
How could I ever hurt you?

10:37.400 --> 10:39.600
I finally found you after all this time—

10:40.360 --> 10:41.920
I won't lose you again.

10:42.160 --> 10:43.960
You're holding me too tightly...

10:43.960 --> 10:44.680
It hurts.

10:45.560 --> 10:47.360
Can you help me up?

10:47.380 --> 10:48.180
I'm sorry.

10:48.920 --> 10:50.170
I didn't mean to.

11:03.670 --> 11:05.670
I have no idea how Master is doing...

11:05.760 --> 11:08.440
For now, I can only pretend to comply.

11:10.360 --> 11:11.120
Yanzhi,

11:12.580 --> 11:15.220
can you pat my head again?

11:15.960 --> 11:17.640
Just like before.

11:33.150 --> 11:33.950
Qi,

11:36.250 --> 11:39.670
did you choose that name yourself?

11:39.690 --> 11:40.610
No.

11:42.880 --> 11:45.080
They gave it to me.

11:45.420 --> 11:47.290
I hate being called that,

11:48.580 --> 11:50.360
so I killed everyone

11:51.930 --> 11:53.210
who called me that.

11:55.200 --> 11:57.210
Everyone—except Master, of course.

11:57.210 --> 11:58.550
But

11:59.960 --> 12:01.800
I call you that too.

12:04.160 --> 12:05.220
You're different.

12:05.600 --> 12:06.790
I like you.

12:07.710 --> 12:09.390
I like it when you call me that.

12:09.410 --> 12:10.330
Qi,

12:11.860 --> 12:13.630
you said "Master" just now.

12:15.360 --> 12:16.540
Are you with Meng Shuo?

12:16.540 --> 12:19.600
Hahaha...

12:21.970 --> 12:23.410
Thanks to your master,

12:23.860 --> 12:25.190
Meng Shuo is dead.

12:25.480 --> 12:26.440
Now

12:27.940 --> 12:30.000
I am the Tower Master of Lingya Tower.

12:30.920 --> 12:31.720
You...

12:33.560 --> 12:35.420
How could you be the Tower Master?

12:36.520 --> 12:38.050
Then... where is my master?

12:38.840 --> 12:40.770
I've served Master for many years.

12:41.060 --> 12:43.320
Of course this is Master's arrangement.

12:43.480 --> 12:45.740
Your master tried to assassinate Master

12:46.600 --> 12:47.720
and was captured.

12:49.150 --> 12:52.420
The "Master" you refer to is Hei Ya.

12:54.520 --> 12:55.850
Then where is my master?

12:57.360 --> 12:58.840
If you want her to live,

12:59.250 --> 13:00.570
you'll do as I say.

13:12.100 --> 13:13.270
Qi...

13:14.500 --> 13:16.440
you've set this place up like this...

13:16.440 --> 13:17.660
are you—

13:19.360 --> 13:20.640
I want to marry you.

13:21.320 --> 13:22.180
Tomorrow night

13:23.080 --> 13:25.080
will be our wedding night.

13:25.830 --> 13:28.610
You want to marry me?

13:28.920 --> 13:29.840
Don't worry.

13:30.520 --> 13:32.080
I won't hurt you.

13:32.400 --> 13:34.800
I'm now the Tower Master
of Lingya Tower.

13:34.880 --> 13:36.780
I can give you whatever you want.

13:40.600 --> 13:42.240
I just want you by my side

13:44.280 --> 13:45.720
and to treat you well.

13:47.280 --> 13:48.260
Qi...

13:49.120 --> 13:49.600
I...

13:49.600 --> 13:51.220
getting married like this

13:51.280 --> 13:52.830
is all too sudden.

13:53.000 --> 13:54.460
I... I-I...

13:54.640 --> 13:56.880
I know you like me,

13:56.880 --> 13:57.760
Qi.

13:58.200 --> 14:01.380
But feelings take time to grow.

14:02.380 --> 14:05.580
Why don't we spend
a few more days together?

14:06.000 --> 14:08.240
Let me calm my heart first.

14:08.440 --> 14:09.360
Okay?

14:09.620 --> 14:10.860
Nan Yanzhi,

14:12.160 --> 14:13.960
we're both intelligent people.

14:14.780 --> 14:17.140
There's no need for such lies.

14:17.520 --> 14:18.520
Qi,

14:20.330 --> 14:21.970
if you truly care for me,

14:22.440 --> 14:23.600
you should respect me

14:23.600 --> 14:24.840
and not force me.

14:24.860 --> 14:25.950
Nan Yanzhi,

14:26.760 --> 14:28.280
do you know how much effort I spent

14:28.280 --> 14:30.940
persuading Master to allow this wedding?

14:33.090 --> 14:33.950
Tomorrow night

14:34.800 --> 14:36.600
is the Lantern Festival—

14:37.360 --> 14:39.130
and the time of our wedding.

14:39.320 --> 14:40.650
If you agree to marry me,

14:41.520 --> 14:42.680
your master

14:43.080 --> 14:44.520
and all your friends

14:45.320 --> 14:47.790
will be alive to attend our wedding.

14:50.000 --> 14:51.200
If you refuse,

14:51.200 --> 14:53.130
then there won't be any wedding...

14:57.040 --> 15:00.270
and there's no reason
for them to live either.

15:01.810 --> 15:02.530
Alright.

15:03.140 --> 15:04.000
I'll marry you.

15:04.280 --> 15:05.920
Hahaha...

15:06.560 --> 15:08.520
But I have one condition:

15:09.430 --> 15:11.560
not a single one of them
can be missing.

15:26.240 --> 15:28.160
So you're one of Hei Ya's people.

15:30.480 --> 15:31.800
If not for that,

15:33.160 --> 15:36.090
perhaps we would never
have had such a relationship.

15:37.400 --> 15:38.600
"The relationship?"

15:39.160 --> 15:40.160
You and I walk different paths.

15:40.160 --> 15:41.680
There is no relationship between us.

15:41.680 --> 15:43.880
You are Yanzhi's master.

15:44.880 --> 15:46.140
I've come to invite you

15:46.480 --> 15:49.240
to witness our wedding.

15:50.600 --> 15:51.960
Release Yanzhi. Now.

15:53.520 --> 15:54.520
Don't worry.

15:55.800 --> 15:58.060
I am now the Tower Master
of Lingya Tower.

16:00.000 --> 16:01.720
Yanzhi will be safe—

16:02.390 --> 16:03.960
as long as she marries me.

16:04.520 --> 16:05.440
Hmph.

16:05.760 --> 16:07.360
You? You're not even worthy.

16:08.270 --> 16:10.800
Look at yourself in the water
and see who you are.

16:10.800 --> 16:11.760
How are you

16:12.000 --> 16:13.520
any different from Meng Shuo?

16:13.520 --> 16:15.050
I am nothing like Meng Shuo.

16:15.120 --> 16:16.380
He was driven by greed.

16:18.080 --> 16:20.210
I have only Yanzhi in my eyes.

16:21.860 --> 16:23.700
You are beyond saving.

16:35.400 --> 16:37.460
Truthfully... I sometimes envy you.

16:38.740 --> 16:41.520
You got to stay by Yanzhi's side
and share so much with her.

16:41.520 --> 16:44.180
Thank you for taking care
of her all these years.

16:46.320 --> 16:47.520
From here on,

16:49.040 --> 16:50.600
I will take care of her.

17:00.380 --> 17:02.620
Dao. Chilantuya.

17:09.440 --> 17:10.480
You two,

17:12.400 --> 17:13.260
please come in.

17:19.380 --> 17:20.770
It's you.
